---
description: Hotwire views and Stimulus
globs: ["app/views/**/*", "app/components/**/*", "app/javascript/**/*.js", "app/frontend/controllers/**/*.ts"]
---
- Turbo Frames/Streams before custom JS; dom_id for targets.
- Stimulus: one job per controller, use targets/values, no globals.
- No logic in ERB beyond presentation; extract partials/ViewComponents.
